        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86187, 48 Inch Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 48 Inch Square Door Pull is a 4 foot door pull with a 1-1/8 inch grip. This is the perfect size for larger doors where a dramatic look is desired. The Stainless Steel 48 Inch Square Door Pull has 36 inch mounting centers. It comes standard for doors 1-3/4  inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86187-Specifications.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"597\" height=\"124\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86187 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in Other Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86191\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-36-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86192\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, or\r\n<a href=\"/products/72-inch-stainless-steel-square-door-pull-emtek-86188\"><b>72\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 86187 Contemporary Square 48 Inch Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\" </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\" (with rosette)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door. Packaged with  Decorative Screw Cover Caps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Concealed Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Comes as a set of 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Long-Pulls-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354641\" width=\"585\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Long Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
